#: analyzer/templates/home.html:783
msgid ""
"Parties that started later in the period are placed using only the motions "
"they voted on."
msgstr "Partijen die later in de periode begonnen, staan op basis van alleen de moties waarover zij stemden."

#: analyzer/templates/home.html:790
msgid "How often they vote alike"
msgstr "Hoe vaak ze gelijk stemmen"

#: analyzer/templates/home.html:791
msgid ""
"The share of motions on which two parties voted the same, out of those they "
"both voted on. Parties that vote alike are grouped, so blocs show as dark "
"squares along the diagonal."
msgstr "Het aandeel moties waarop twee partijen hetzelfde stemden, van de moties waarover ze allebei stemden. Partijen die gelijk stemmen staan bij elkaar, dus blokken verschijnen als donkere vlakken langs de diagonaal."

